# Vite
*.timestamp-*-*.mjs

# CDP trace raw evidence (scripts/cdp-trace/) — regenerable via the scripts,
# but expensive to re-capture; kept on disk locally, never committed.
# Committed evidence lives in results/cdp-trace/**/*.md and
# results/cdp-trace/validation/matrix-analysis.json instead.
results/cdp-trace/**/*.trace.json
results/cdp-trace/**/*.meta.json

# Layer A (page instrumentation) raw per-trial JSON from
# run-composable-chaos-instrumentation.ts — same rationale as above,
# regenerable, not committed. Summarized findings live in
# src/benchmarks/validation-log.md and the composable-chaos README instead.
results/cdp-trace/composable-chaos-instrumentation/**/*.json

# Claude skills：只追蹤 create-pain-scenario、validate-vue-update 與 load-data，其他 skill 只留在本機
.claude/skills/*
